      en: [
        { type: "p", text: "Most AI demos look great on a table. You ask, it answers, everyone smiles. Then you hit real data, permissions, the CRM, and daily work — and the demo stays a demo." },
        { type: "p", text: "At Beo System an agent is measured by what it does inside the business: does it cut time, close a hole in the process, and connect to systems that already run." },
        { type: "h2", text: "Who, what and how: what Beo System actually builds" },
        { type: "p", text: "Who: Beo System (ביו סיסטם) is a website, app and AI systems development company, working from Kiryat Bialik and Dubai." },
        { type: "p", text: "What: AI agents that act inside the business systems: they read data, write to the CRM and open tasks." },
        { type: "p", text: "How: we start with one process, and the agent hands off to a person when needed." },
        { type: "h2", text: "Chat vs agent" },
        { type: "p", text: "Chat answers. An agent acts. It takes a request, reads context, checks the system, opens a task, updates status, and knows when to stop and ask a person." },
        { type: "p", text: "Without data and permissions, it is still a reply bot. With a connection, it is a digital worker sitting in the process." },
        { type: "h2", text: "How an agent enters without breaking the business" },
        { type: "p", text: "Start with one narrow process: leads, service, scheduling, or classifying requests. Define what the agent may do, what it may not, and where a person must approve." },
        { type: "p", text: "Only after a real result do you expand. That is how you avoid an “AI department” on slides, and get a routine that works." },
        { type: "p", text: "A small business or an agency can start the same way: one agent, one process, one channel. In an agency, clients are kept separate from day one." },
        { type: "p", text: "Want to start with simple rules? See [business automation](https://beosystem.com/blog/ai-automation-start)." },
        { type: "h2", text: "What to check first" },
        { type: "p", text: "Where time burns today. Which system is the source of truth. Who approves. And what happens when the agent is wrong. If the last three have no answer, you are not ready yet — and that is fine. Start there." },
        { type: "h2", text: "FAQ before you start" },
        { type: "p", text: "What is an AI agent for a business? It takes a request, reads data, decides by a rule, and writes to a CRM or a task. It hands off to a person when approval is needed. Without a system connection it is still chat." },
        { type: "p", text: "Does an AI agent for a business replace staff? No. It closes one narrow process. Price, commitment, and a sensitive conversation stay with a person." },
        { type: "p", text: "When is an AI agent worth it vs a chatbot? When you need action in a system — status, task, CRM update — not only an answer in a site widget." },
        { type: "p", text: "Where to start without an «AI department» on a slide deck? One narrow process: leads, request routing, or a first handoff to WhatsApp — with clear limits on what the agent may do and what needs a human." },
        { type: "p", text: "What must be clear before you reach out? Where time burns, which system is the source of truth, who approves, and what happens when the agent is wrong." },
        { type: "p", text: "How do you build an AI agent for a small business? Pick one process that repeats a lot, such as replying to leads or booking meetings. Define what the agent does and when it hands off to a person. Connect it to the WhatsApp or CRM you already have, and test it on real inquiries before you expand." },
        { type: "p", text: "How do you build an AI agent for an agency? An agency works with several clients, so you need clear separation: separate data, texts and permissions for each client. Start with one client and one process, and only then copy it to more clients." },
        { type: "p", text: "Do you need a development team to build an AI agent? Not an in-house one. You need someone in the business who knows the process, and a technical partner who connects the agent to your systems and tests it." },
        { type: "p", text: "How to contact now? WhatsApp or the site form. Short note: what the business is and which process you want to close first." },
        { type: "p", text: "Is Beo System related to BEO Software? No. Beo System (ביו סיסטם) is an Israeli company from Kiryat Bialik, also working in Dubai. It is not affiliated with BEO Software in Germany, which builds customs and logistics software." },
        { type: "h2", text: "Want to check one process" },
        { type: "p", text: "Leave a short note — we’ll see together whether a narrow agent on one process fits before expanding." },
        { type: "p", text: "https://wa.me/33632519053?text=%D7%94%D7%99%D7%99%2C%20%D7%90%D7%A9%D7%9E%D7%97%20%D7%9C%D7%93%D7%91%D7%A8%20%D7%A2%D7%9C%20%D7%A1%D7%95%D7%9B%D7%9F%20AI%20%D7%9C%D7%A2%D7%A1%D7%A7" },
        { type: "p", text: "https://beosystem.com/#contact" },
        { type: "h2", text: "More in the same direction" },
        { type: "p", text: "https://beosystem.com/blog/chatbot-vs-agent" },
        { type: "p", text: "https://beosystem.com/blog/ai-lead-agent" },
        { type: "p", text: "https://beosystem.com/blog/ai-automation-start" },
      ],
