      en: [
        { type: "p", text: "Many businesses look for a «business chatbot» and expect it to close leads. Then they find chats on the site — but no CRM row, no timely WhatsApp, and no person continuing when needed." },
        { type: "p", text: "Beo System (ביו סיסטם) builds both chat and AI agents — but starts with the right question: do you need answers, or a process that closes." },
        { type: "h2", text: "Who we are, what we build and how" },
        { type: "p", text: "Who: Beo System (ביו סיסטם) is a website, app and AI systems development company, working from Kiryat Bialik and Dubai." },
        { type: "p", text: "What: we build chatbots for websites and WhatsApp, and AI agents connected to the CRM and the business systems." },
        { type: "p", text: "How: we start with one process. We check whether answers or actions are missing, and only then pick the tool." },
        { type: "h2", text: "Chatbot vs AI agent" },
        { type: "p", text: "A chatbot answers. An AI agent acts on a process: it classifies, writes a record, and hands off to a person. The choice depends on whether you are missing answers to repeated questions, or a process that reaches the team." },
        { type: "h2", text: "What a chatbot does well" },
        { type: "p", text: "After-hours replies, FAQs, light qualification, and a push to a page or form. When the goal is cutting repeated questions — an on-page chat is enough." },
        { type: "p", text: "Without a system connection it stays a conversation layer. It does not open a task, update status, or know who on the team is free." },
        { type: "h2", text: "What an AI agent adds" },
        { type: "p", text: "An agent reads the request, classifies intent, writes to CRM or a queue, sends WhatsApp by rule, and hands off to a person on exceptions or approval." },
        { type: "p", text: "The metric is not «how many messages». It is whether the lead reached the right place, with context, on time." },
        { type: "h2", text: "WhatsApp chatbot: chatbot or agent?" },
        { type: "p", text: "Many businesses want replies on WhatsApp, not on the site. There are two levels there too." },
        { type: "p", text: "A WhatsApp chatbot answers repeated questions: hours, price list, address. That takes load off the team." },
        { type: "p", text: "An agent on WhatsApp does more. It asks a few questions, opens a lead in the system, and hands off to a team member when needed." },
        { type: "p", text: "Both levels run on the WhatsApp Business API. More in [WhatsApp bot for business](https://beosystem.com/blog/whatsapp-ai-agent)." },
        { type: "h2", text: "Example: the same request, two outcomes" },
        { type: "p", text: "A customer writes in the evening: \"Can I book an appointment next week?\"" },
        { type: "p", text: "A chatbot replies with opening hours and sends a link to a form. If the customer does not fill it in, the request is lost." },
        { type: "p", text: "An AI agent checks the calendar, offers a time, records the customer in the system, and sends a WhatsApp confirmation. If something is unclear, it hands off to a person. More in [AI appointment scheduling](https://beosystem.com/blog/ai-appointment-scheduling)." },
        { type: "h2", text: "How to choose without buying both worlds" },
        { type: "p", text: "If most traffic is repeated questions and there is no active sales funnel — start with chat. If leads vanish between site, WhatsApp, and spreadsheets — start with an agent on one narrow process." },
        { type: "p", text: "You can grow: answers first, then system connection. The reverse order without a source of truth only speeds up confusion." },
        { type: "h2", text: "What Beo System checks before install" },
        { type: "p", text: "Where requests enter today. Which system is the source of truth. Who approves a quote or call. And what happens when classification is wrong." },
        { type: "p", text: "We work with businesses in Israel (Kiryat Bialik) and Dubai: site, CRM, and agents tied to data — not three vendors with gaps in the middle." },
        { type: "h2", text: "FAQ before you reach out" },
        { type: "p", text: "What is the difference between a chatbot and an AI agent? A chatbot answers repeated questions in a widget. An AI agent reads the request, writes to a CRM or a queue, and can send WhatsApp. Without a system connection it stays chat." },
        { type: "p", text: "Chatbot vs AI agent — what to choose first? If most inquiries are repeated questions, start with chat. If leads vanish between the site and WhatsApp, start with an agent on one process." },
        { type: "p", text: "When is a chatbot enough? When the main goal is answers and FAQs, and leads are already handled reliably elsewhere." },
        { type: "p", text: "When move to an agent? When requests arrive, but nothing reliably reaches CRM and the team on time." },
        { type: "p", text: "Can you start small? Yes. Start with one process, for example from the site form to a WhatsApp message, not a full «AI department»." },
        { type: "p", text: "What is a WhatsApp chatbot? A bot that answers customers' repeated questions on WhatsApp. When it also opens a lead in the system and hands off to the team, it is close to an AI agent." },
        { type: "p", text: "Can a chatbot book appointments? A regular chatbot only points to a form or a link. Actually booking needs a calendar connection, and that is an agent's job." },
        { type: "p", text: "Can an AI agent answer the phone too? Yes. A voice agent answers calls and hands off to a person when needed. See [AI phone agent](https://beosystem.com/blog/voice-ai-phone-agent)." },
        { type: "p", text: "How much does it cost? It depends on the integrations and the scope of the process. What drives the price: [how much an AI agent costs](https://beosystem.com/blog/ai-agent-custom-system-cost)." },
        { type: "p", text: "How to contact now? WhatsApp or the site form. Short note: what the business is and where chat breaks before the team." },
        { type: "p", text: "Is Beo System related to BEO Software? No. Beo System is an Israeli studio and is not affiliated with BEO Software in Germany (customs and logistics software)." },
        { type: "h2", text: "Want to check what fits" },
        { type: "p", text: "Leave a short note — we’ll see together whether chat, an agent, or wiring both is the right next step." },
        { type: "p", text: "https://wa.me/33632519053?text=Hi%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20talk%20about%20a%20chatbot%20vs%20an%20AI%20agent" },
        { type: "p", text: "https://beosystem.com/#contact" },
        { type: "p", text: "When the reply channel is WhatsApp, see our guide to [WhatsApp bots](https://beosystem.com/blog/whatsapp-ai-agent)." },
        { type: "h2", text: "More in the same direction" },
        { type: "p", text: "https://beosystem.com/blog/whatsapp-ai-agent" },
        { type: "p", text: "https://beosystem.com/blog/ai-agents" },
        { type: "p", text: "https://beosystem.com/blog/ai-lead-agent" },
        { type: "p", text: "https://beosystem.com/blog/ai-appointment-scheduling" },
        { type: "p", text: "https://beosystem.com/blog/inquiry-management" },
      ],
